---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — InHand."
  description="Privacy policy and data protection terms for InHand (salary.shivrajsinh.in)."
  canonicalUrl="https://salary.shivrajsinh.in/privacy/"
>
  <div class="container max-w-3xl py-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate text-sm space-y-5 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        At <strong>InHand.</strong> (accessible from <code>https://salary.shivrajsinh.in</code>), your privacy is of paramount importance to us. This privacy policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by InHand and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Client-Side Processing & Zero Financial Data Storage</h2>
      <p>
        All calculations performed on InHand (including your salary inputs, CTC numbers, deductions, loan details, and tax regime selections) are processed <strong>100% locally in your web browser</strong> using client-side JavaScript. We do not transmit, record, or store your personal financial numbers on any remote servers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie & AdSense</h2>
      <p>
        Google is a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-teal-700 underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Log Files & Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Like most web servers, our hosting infrastructure automatically logs standard anonymized visit metrics including Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamp, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <code>privacy@shivrajsinh.in</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
